<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 117 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 117 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet to February 28 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to February 21</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 62,002	 61,885</p>
<p> Money market intervention    12,104	 14,823</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,907	  1,907</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,259	  2,263</p>
<p> Total assets		     85,399	 87,998</p>
<p>In the previous week to Februay 21 reserves rose by 213 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
